notes[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-21T08:16:01.440Z",codex,"TDD red evidence: after updating handler expectations,the full handler suite failed three assertions. Production still emitted the deprecated --path/list-all/--full argv instead of --pm-path/list/--all/--output-include full,the parse error still named list-all,and an envelope missing the include read-output dimension was accepted. The other 39 handler tests passed."
  "2026-08-21T08:33:18.586Z",codex,"Green local evidence on 2026-08-21: release:check passed 174 tests,configured index.ts 100/100/100,55 documented declarations,zero production vulnerabilities,9 packed files,three fresh installed-host scenarios,and deterministic changelog. npm-current and bun-current used pm 2026.8.21; npm-minimum used 2026.8.20. Each scenario created real tracker data and successfully ran pm gantt plus JSON export without list-all diagnostics. Tracker validation found zero drift,zero pending merge decisions,and zero duplicate candidates; strict health retained three legacy provenance advisories."
  "2026-08-21T08:46:24.908Z",codex,"author=codex,text=CodeRabbit exact-head review raised ten findings. Evidence confirms wm40 first shipped in v2026.08.10. Accepted fixes harden Node floor selection, pinned changelog host resolution, peer-floor parsing, subprocess timeouts, npm-reported tarball filenames, structural export assertions, single-invocation regression coverage, explicit fail-closed receipt contract versions, and the independent quality-item file inventory. The unreadable counter guard was simplified because value !== 0 is sufficient. Full gates will be rerun before review responses are resolved."
  "2026-08-21T08:49:08.653Z",codex,"Post-CodeRabbit fixes pass full release:check with 175 tests,exact configured index.ts 100/100/100,55 documented declarations,zero production vulnerabilities,the nine-file tarball,and npm-current Bun-current npm-minimum real acceptance. Changelog now records wm40 in the first containing tag v2026.08.10. The temporary npm pack JSON failure exposed prepare-hook stdout; the acceptance pack now uses --ignore-scripts because the immediately preceding lifecycle-enabled pack dry-run already builds and verifies hooks,yielding a deterministic filename receipt."
